# Agent tooling, not application source.
#
# `npx skills add` installs third-party skill packs here — design guidance for
# whoever happens to be pairing with an AI, unrelated to what the app does and
# unread by anything that runs. Kept out of the repo so a checkout stays about
# the product. skills-lock.json is the manifest that reproduces the set, so
# commit that instead if the team wants the same packs.
.agents/
.claude/
skills-lock.json
